  "goodToKnow": "Das Bundesministerium is a federal ministry, usually abbreviated BM plus a letter: das BMF (Finanzen), das BMI (Innern), das BMBF (Bildung und Forschung). Because Bonn was West Germany's capital, the 1994 Berlin/Bonn Act left six ministries with their main seat in Bonn, so there's a lot of travel between the two cities. Ministries are led by a Bundesminister, with Staatssekretäre below. Plural: die Bundesministerien."
